the radial connector should not literally be called tangential velocity
rather, it is a light-cone / causal-slice marker whose tilt is controlled by tangential velocity

7. Dimensional clipping distinction:

projection gives circle → ellipse → line
pure zero-thickness intersection gives circle → two points more abruptly
finite-thickness intersection restores circle → oblong → line-like → two-point behavior

No downloadable artifact, script, notebook, diagram, or numerical simulation was created.

## 6. What were you planning to create but never finished?

The next unfinished step is a precise 4D mathematical setup for the circular-worldline/time-slice intersection model.

